WEBVTT

00:03.080 --> 00:08.640
Following the initial rise and glory of Great Xuan, incompetent monarchs followed in succession, and factional strife tore the court apart.

00:08.720 --> 00:12.320
The northern Wunu seized the moment to invade south, swiftly capturing Guanzhong.

00:13.240 --> 00:16.160
Before long, the imperial capital of Yong'an fell.

00:16.240 --> 00:20.880
The imperial clan was dragged off in chains, and the common people were ruthlessly slaughtered.

00:21.440 --> 00:26.400
Only the natural chasm of the Tianhe River barely preserved half the fallen realm.

00:26.960 --> 00:30.160
Sikong Jing, the Prince of Langya, was merely a distant branch of the royal line;

00:30.240 --> 00:35.400
yet Chancellor Chen Dao, joined by the great aristocratic clans, enthroned him as the new Emperor.

00:35.480 --> 00:38.880
Here, south of the Tianhe River, he inherited the imperial mantle.

00:39.600 --> 00:45.120
You are Sikong Yao, the second son of His Imperial Majesty, enfeoffed as the Prince of Jin.

00:45.360 --> 00:49.760
In this tumultuous, war-torn era, what path will you choose?

00:49.960 --> 00:55.880
How will the tides of history turn? Everything... is yours to forge.

01:05.480 --> 01:09.240
What has happened? Must you go out so late into the night?

01:09.320 --> 01:14.867
Do not worry. Just a few poet friends had a bit too much to drink and caused some commotion. I will go settle it.

01:32.160 --> 01:36.280
When a prince goes out on business, you cannot appear destitute. Take this with you.

01:39.800 --> 01:43.200
This piece of Kunshan jade could easily cover our household's expenses for months.

01:44.040 --> 01:47.520
Unless it is someone truly vital, do not part with it lightly.
